<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Campbell Bros half year net profit up.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Campbell Bros half year net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     5.02 vs 3.96</p>
<p>    Net					3.10 vs 1.95</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     8.00 vs 7.00</p>
<p>    Sales				   59.90 vs 56.50</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.34 vs 0.40</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   13.56 vs 10.95</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs loss 0.63</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date Dec 13  </p>
<p>Reg date Nov 27</p>
<p>    Tax					1.92 vs 1.36</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.38 vs 0.84</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   2.33 vs 2.25</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs 0.24</p>
<p>NOTE: Campbell Brothers Ltd is an industrial products and services provider.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
